~ initialize_local_variables

=> start

~ start
if Variables.get_var("0_1_death") == 1
	A frail fragment: You hear her rapidly approaching behind you. She catches up in an instant.
	A frail fragment: You feel her fingernails dig into your sides and her teeth bite into the back of your neck. 
	A frail fragment: She picks you up like you weigh nothing and spins you around. The smell of her breath is unbearable.
	A frail fragment: [do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_joan_wheeze")]The last thing you see is her slimy eyes as she leans in. 
	A frail fragment: Her lips touch yours, and then you die. 
	do DialogueFuncs.unlock_achievement("Lips As Soft As Death - Don't kiss and tell!")
	do DialogueFuncs.kill_player(DialogueFuncs.KillPlayerAction.SHOW_DEATH_SCREEN) 
	=> END
elif Variables.get_var("0_1_death") == 2
	A frail fragment: You see her leap at you, almost inhumanly fast. 
	A frail fragment: Before you're able to react, she slashes your eyes with fingernails as sharp as knives. 
	A frail fragment: Unable to see anything anymore, you hear yourself scream in agony as you desperately try to get a hit in yourself. 
	A frail fragment: You feel a sharp pang of pain as she slashes again. And again. 
	A frail fragment: She then digs into your sides and picks you up like you weigh nothing.[do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_joan_wheeze")] You feel her breath as she leans in. The smell is unbearable.
	A frail fragment: As her lips touch yours, you die.
	do DialogueFuncs.unlock_achievement("Lips As Soft As Death - Don't kiss and tell!")
	do DialogueFuncs.kill_player(DialogueFuncs.KillPlayerAction.SHOW_DEATH_SCREEN)
	=> END